        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Marine Air Control Group 48, United States Marine Corps, United States Navy, 4th Marine Aircraft Wing, Marine Forces Reserve\n- Places: Naval Station Great Lakes, North Chicago, Lake County, Illinois\n- Roles: aviation command and control, tactical headquarters, aircraft control, air defense\n\nFacts:\n- Naval Station Great Lakes is located near North Chicago in Lake County, Illinois.\n- Naval Station Great Lakes is the home of the United States Navy's only boot camp.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 is a United States Marine Corps aviation command and control unit based at Naval Station Great Lakes.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 is currently composed of four squadrons.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 provides the 4th Marine Aircraft Wing and Marine Forces Reserve with a tactical headquarters, positive and procedural control of aircraft, air defense, and aviation command and control.",
